            <div xml:id="m-a88f49d9-668c-47a6-8481-bc9988d5e400">
              <lg xml:id="m-c609675a-ceb7-40da-a6b1-fb791e6f72cc">
                <l xml:id="m-d0b92bbc-54fc-48f6-89f0-10884f7861db" facs="#m-cc3ac9e4-e738-416e-b708-6d98b483f60a" label="text-like">Common of a Confessor Bishop. Mass I.</l><l xml:id="m-ee0553da-bc38-4d6d-af29-9a76bac07c0c" facs="#m-1e118ebb-900f-44a3-b011-68d9cf83eac5" label="ambiguous">n183</l><l xml:id="m-be703c3d-5557-414c-ae69-06af4f4fd5e3" facs="#m-632b0426-5807-4ee5-a274-296c2ef9d529" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-9ec68148-d010-41a9-8c21-118e85e18c88" facs="#m-c13639b9-30b1-4ea5-b852-04d78c9bdde1" label="lyrics-like">A, quaésumus omnípotens solémnitas, * et devotiónem nobis</l><l xml:id="m-2a1804e5-ef6c-45db-a666-c983b4ee7b16" facs="#m-21269006-2e76-46e1-a5ea-455c2a1f72ea" label="lyrics-like">1 Deus: t ut beáti N. Confessó-] augeat et salútem. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-ed127090-098f-4267-b66d-3ff5211afa8b" facs="#m-26201c02-1ac0-4fd6-8429-184eb9f696d0" label="lyrics-like">ris tui atque Pontíficis veneránda</l><l xml:id="m-59b1d7cd-204a-4201-9477-7b065ed92313" facs="#m-a1a91a87-aa28-443f-aef7-13806f061ee0" label="ambiguous">Lectio libri Sapientiae. Eccli. 44. et 45.</l><l xml:id="m-1aad6917-8b60-4b9b-8ff5-020e4613bd32" facs="#m-75aa431b-3e48-43de-a6b2-abd3373e934a" label="lyrics-like">YCce sacérdos magnus, qui inl nedictiónibus suis: conservávit illi</l><l xml:id="m-1acd6858-7d02-4b20-aa3d-ffcb166f04b5" facs="#m-6d641ecf-4b11-4ed4-b875-7cc6b7d43609" label="lyrics-like">U diébus suis plácuit Deo, et in¬</l><l xml:id="m-94f35336-94b8-41de-8dd7-2f3104313cfd" facs="#m-bf4872a3-bb8a-4462-801b-b8491188784b" label="lyrics-like">misericórdiam suam: et invénit</l><l xml:id="m-dd49243a-2987-4c79-a661-5fd2a9bbc043" facs="#m-1a970b8a-9e24-41ce-ba6e-32fc8428da20" label="lyrics-like">grátiam coram óculis Dómini. Ma¬</l><l xml:id="m-6eaba4be-e066-44a4-9de4-8359c62f75fb" facs="#m-b33f9099-ba0b-4d77-8afa-fd3f4bf7b60f" label="lyrics-like">véntus est justus: et in témpore</l><l xml:id="m-0f038f8b-b810-4922-9595-abecf8f55fa2" facs="#m-ed00f9b2-24d6-4715-9208-68f478be080a" label="lyrics-like">iracúndiae factus est reconciliãtio.</l><l xml:id="m-3f32a842-4340-43de-9d58-16a107d704cc" facs="#m-45c00d41-10f9-4147-bfbe-64159fa39304" label="lyrics-like">gnificávit eum in conspéctu regum:</l><l xml:id="m-fdfded68-d5b8-4b64-b67e-1005e6af7a1d" facs="#m-0a300f62-89d9-4cde-bf14-138e12054e40" label="lyrics-like">et dedit illi corónam glóriae. Stá¬</l><l xml:id="m-629aa833-afae-4705-b17f-921f6b330184" facs="#m-1c604b80-aaa2-4d8b-acc5-6e1f1d19aec6" label="lyrics-like">Non est invéntus símilis illi, qui</l><l xml:id="m-78ee4c99-6175-4eca-a10e-327d9908a41e" facs="#m-dd9195e9-df55-446b-b8b9-da61b7e9b807" label="lyrics-like">conservávit legem Excélsi. Ideo ju¬</l><l xml:id="m-5bffccb1-f741-43e1-b49d-49bc60fafe2f" facs="#m-19701df9-01a2-4931-9c22-97e64ef2036f" label="lyrics-like">tuit illi testaméntum aetérnum, et</l><l xml:id="m-4dd9fa2e-faff-480f-ad1b-71ba4642951c" facs="#m-12597b87-4e5b-444b-b2f0-1593ae3e3cfa" label="lyrics-like">dedit illi sacerdótium magnum: et</l><l xml:id="m-2e5be280-4ca1-4cb2-b6c5-8decc9df8fce" facs="#m-21af57c5-eca4-4bc1-a9d3-e8f73b3aa493" label="lyrics-like">rejurándo fecit illum Dóminus cré¬</l><l xml:id="m-6fa8bf8a-e989-4be9-9e4f-cfdf3e3237f0" facs="#m-afe20cb7-1762-4357-89c8-cf71204fb9d0" label="lyrics-like">beatificávit illum in glória. Fungi</l><l xml:id="m-022e7131-103e-473b-ad42-41450302a524" facs="#m-ca55463d-a8a4-44a2-bcc7-a6690d7cef11" label="lyrics-like">scere in plebem suam. Benedictió¬</l><l xml:id="m-0e3a5c6d-6255-4fcc-9449-3d37df7478c1" facs="#m-a7b0ac58-5e10-45b6-9f2a-6a87d62df20d" label="lyrics-like">nem ómnium géntium dedit illi, et! sacerdótio, et habére laudem in nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-e9e22e3c-0867-48d3-afbf-5bd9d386c630" facs="#m-4a903f59-1a0e-4002-bbff-eced121a4b99" label="lyrics-like">testaméntum suum confirmávit su-] mine ipsius, et offérre illi incénsum</l><l xml:id="m-c9f51920-0f2c-45f9-bd1b-e13325524907" facs="#m-ceeea757-eaa2-4db4-8f1c-b2950f5fa8e5" label="lyrics-like">per caput ejus. Agnóvit eum in be- dignum in odórem suavitátis.</l><l xml:id="m-f7315dcf-8110-4151-ad71-5c5d1e824def" facs="#m-0c2c9758-6eaf-4a31-b33a-33ecf95251eb" label="ambiguous">Grad. E</l><l xml:id="m-937d994a-ca62-4ef4-82dc-2952763f3361" facs="#m-2e9b505f-814d-4cb7-951b-3a7d030bfddc" label="lyrics-like">gnus, qui in di-é¬</l><l xml:id="m-a3eaf2ea-35eb-4825-9eb2-291d1fb4a53a" facs="#m-6198b10a-526b-45d0-bbc3-cb93db30c823" label="lyrics-like">UC-ce “ sacérdos má¬</l><l xml:id="m-4c768a04-fa7e-46b7-b1b7-da02eedfd639" facs="#m-b4c44729-eed7-403a-bec5-610f5c0a5a83" label="lyrics-like">Dé¬ O.</l><l xml:id="m-9f9251ef-6384-4b39-af43-3711792e7e51" facs="#m-5ccf1547-9b4a-490d-91fd-393f8a106ba5" label="lyrics-like">is plá¬ cu¬ it</l><l xml:id="m-cf4fee95-196c-4fa8-8e90-9dc6b203c96e" facs="#m-4630abc5-3b4b-41bc-9b37-5860a7cdb1ed" label="lyrics-like">bus sú¬</l><l xml:id="m-3c0a4e4f-9349-44c6-b9c8-41564c0d38d6" facs="#m-dce392b1-486a-4c48-8b67-0148da8cc394" label="lyrics-like">V. Non est invéntus sími-lis fl-li.</l><l xml:id="m-44ad634b-706a-4b0f-94e7-21e3c66e8ca4" facs="#m-8a4aa6b9-3406-43b8-b012-2725e992604a" label="lyrics-like">qui conservá¬</l><l xml:id="m-e39c7303-db6d-4d31-b6bd-9b75c997dfd4" facs="#m-1558bf24-e3f7-4f7e-b6d9-7e5a6d018cb9" label="lyrics-like">légem Excél¬</l><l xml:id="m-445cca0c-6da3-4465-a121-242b8f7f99d1" facs="#m-164c8830-02a0-45b8-8c80-d281afa3f9de" label="ambiguous">si.</l><l xml:id="m-961f6c7b-38da-4a99-a6e0-0e5b8ffd3dd9" facs="#m-63b2e0e6-348e-40e7-962d-b324b719ffa6" label="ambiguous">ret</l><l xml:id="m-98fe8098-f55e-4c84-9e30-2cf237965acb" facs="#m-fd720c28-681e-4ea1-b00a-8018af95b2ad" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-fe24639c-f06c-457a-8f36-b131f8deda03" facs="#m-9ec11c1e-8c66-4915-ba72-2486e52fee48" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-2294f523-c574-4e0a-bf12-c6eaf72b724e" facs="#m-ce1f051e-baea-4e75-a88e-f7c38fe67e8a" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia. "ij.</l><l xml:id="m-117d0bd9-480a-4b4a-9b79-5a0c9bc21514" facs="#m-b8be1c9b-0081-465b-8fd0-e0423921c249" label="ambiguous">Lle¬</l><l xml:id="m-f55e53ed-42a6-4c87-9283-5503f3070a64" facs="#m-b8f5a33f-9a2e-453f-be43-d6aa2d234db5" label="ambiguous">Ne 801.— 4</l></lg>
